{"seq":1,"slug":"chunking-strategies","title":"分块策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/indexing/chunking-strategies","wordCount":1243,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"分块策略\">分块策略</h1><p>把一份三千行的源文件整个丢给嵌入模型，既超出它的输入长度，又会让一个向量糊住整份文件的语义。所以索引的第一步永远是切块。但「怎么切」对代码而言绝不是按字符数一刀刀剁——上一章已经论证过代码的自然边界是函数和作用域（见 <a href=\"../foundations/code-vs-text-retrieval\">代码检索的特殊性</a>）。这篇专门讲怎样把这条原则落成可用的分块算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分块要同时满足几个互相拉扯的目标：每块不能切断语法单元（语法完整性）、每块尽量装满到固定预算（信息密度）、不依赖某种语言的特殊规则（语言无关）、块拼起来能逐字还原原文件（可逆/无损）。这四条正是 CMU 在 2026 年的 cAST 工作明确提出的设计目标（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2506.15655v1\">arxiv cAST</a>）。</p>\n<p>把三种分块法摆在一起对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分块法</th>\n<th>边界依据</th>\n<th>语法完整性</th>\n<th>实现成本</th>\n<th>典型问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定字符/行数</td>\n<td>字符计数</td>\n<td>差，常切断函数</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>块语义破碎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口 + 重叠</td>\n<td>字符 + overlap</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>冗余、仍可能切断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AST 感知（tree-sitter / cAST）</td>\n<td>语法节点</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需语言 parser</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>固定大小是文本 RAG 的默认做法，搬到代码上就是上一章说的「函数被拦腰斩断」。重叠窗口靠相邻块共享一段内容来缓解切断，但治标不治本。AST 感知才是代码分块的正解，下面展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tree-sitter-拿到语法树\">tree-sitter：拿到语法树</h2><p>要按语法单元切块，先得把源码解析成抽象语法树（AST）。2026 年的事实标准是 tree-sitter——它身经百战（Neovim、Helix、Zed 的语法高亮都靠它），几乎覆盖所有主流语言，且能增量解析（这点对增量索引很关键，见 <a href=\"freshness-incremental\">新鲜度与增量更新</a> 的对照）。</p>\n<p>拿到 AST 后，朴素做法是「一个函数定义 = 一个块」。这在多数情况下好用，但有两个边界情形：超大函数会超出嵌入模型的长度上限，需要再切；一堆小函数或 import 语句又太碎，单独成块浪费且语义稀薄，需要合并。怎样系统地处理「太大要拆、太小要并」，正是 cAST 的贡献。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[源文件] --&gt; B[tree-sitter 解析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[AST 语法树]&#10;    C --&gt; D{节点大小 vs 预算}&#10;    D --&gt;|超预算| E[递归下钻到子节点]&#10;    D --&gt;|远小于预算| F[与相邻节点合并]&#10;    D --&gt;|刚好| G[直接成块]&#10;    E --&gt; H[语法完整的块集合]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[源文件] --&gt; B[tree-sitter 解析]\n    B --&gt; C[AST 语法树]\n    C --&gt; D{节点大小 vs 预算}\n    D --&gt;|超预算| E[递归下钻到子节点]\n    D --&gt;|远小于预算| F[与相邻节点合并]\n    D --&gt;|刚好| G[直接成块]\n    E --&gt; H[语法完整的块集合]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"cast-split-then-merge\">cAST：split-then-merge</h2><p>cAST（Chunking via AST）的核心是一个递归的「先拆后合」算法。它自顶向下遍历 AST：遇到一个节点，若其文本大小没超过块预算就整个收下；若超了，就递归下钻到它的子节点分别处理；下钻过程中产生的小片段，再贪心地合并到接近预算上限，从而把每块「装满」以保证信息密度（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2506.15655\">arxiv cAST</a>、<a href=\"https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~sherryw/assets/pubs/2025-cast.pdf\">CMU 论文</a>）。</p>\n<p>设块大小预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（按 token 或字符计），对 AST 节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的处理可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>chunk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>text</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>merge</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>children</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mtext>chunk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{chunk}(v) =\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{ \\text{text}(v) \\} &amp; \\text{if } |v| \\le B \\\\\n\\text{merge}\\big( \\bigcup_{c \\in \\text{children}(v)} \\text{chunk}(c),\\ B \\big) &amp; \\text{otherwise}\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">chunk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7114em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.7114em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">text</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.2714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">merge</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋃</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">children</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">chunk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2114em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7114em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.7114em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.2714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2114em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这套算法同时满足前面四个目标：边界永远落在语法节点上（完整性）、merge 把碎片填满（密度）、只依赖通用的「节点有大小、有子节点」抽象而不写语言特例（语言无关）、所有块按序拼接逐字还原原文件（可逆）。supermemory 等开源实现（<a href=\"https://github.com/supermemoryai/code-chunk\">code-chunk</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/yilinjz/astchunk\">astchunk</a>）以及 zilliztech 的 Claude Context MCP server，都采用了「AST 优先、解析失败回退到字符切分」的工程形态。</p>\n<p>工程上常写成一段递归（示意，忽略具体 parser API）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def chunk(node, budget):&#10;    if size(node) &lt;= budget:&#10;        return [text(node)]            # 未超预算：整节点收下&#10;    pieces = []&#10;    for child in children(node):&#10;        pieces += chunk(child, budget)  # 超预算：下钻子节点&#10;    return merge_greedy(pieces, budget) # 把碎片贪心合到接近预算\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node, budget):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> size(node) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> budget:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [text(node)]            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 未超预算：整节点收下</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pieces </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> child </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> children(node):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pieces </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunk(child, budget)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 超预算：下钻子节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merge_greedy(pieces, budget) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 把碎片贪心合到接近预算</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>merge_greedy</code> 按序累加相邻片段直到逼近 <code>budget</code> 再封块，从而在保持语法完整的同时尽量装满每块。</p>\n<h2 id=\"给块加上下文-让它自足\">给块加上下文：让它自足</h2><p>上一章说过代码块往往不自足（见 <a href=\"../foundations/code-vs-text-retrieval\">代码检索的特殊性</a>）。一个常用补救是给每个块附加「定位元数据」与「上下文前缀」：文件路径、所属类/命名空间、必要的 import、上游一句话摘要。这样即便检出一个孤立函数，模型也知道它在哪、属于谁。</p>\n<p>这种「contextual retrieval」式的增强会在嵌入时一并编码（见 <a href=\"code-embeddings\">代码嵌入</a>），并在存储时作为元数据保留（见 <a href=\"index-structures\">索引结构</a>），供后续按路径、语言过滤（见 <a href=\"../retrieval/reranking-filtering\">重排与过滤</a>）。要注意附加上下文会增大块体积、挤占嵌入的语义容量，是一个需要权衡的旋钮，不要无脑塞满。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分块要同时满足语法完整、信息密度、语言无关、可逆四个目标（cAST 提出）。</li>\n<li>固定字符切分会斩断函数，重叠窗口只能缓解，AST 感知才是代码分块正解。</li>\n<li>tree-sitter 是 2026 年解析 AST 的事实标准，朴素「一函数一块」需处理「太大要拆、太小要并」。</li>\n<li>cAST 用递归 split-then-merge 在块预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 下兼顾完整性与密度，工程上常配「解析失败回退字符切分」。</li>\n<li>给块附加路径/类/import 等上下文使其自足，但会挤占嵌入容量，是需权衡的旋钮——嵌入细节见 <a href=\"code-embeddings\">代码嵌入</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分块策略","id":"分块策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"tree-sitter：拿到语法树","id":"tree-sitter-拿到语法树"},{"level":2,"text":"cAST：split-then-merge","id":"cast-split-then-merge"},{"level":2,"text":"给块加上下文：让它自足","id":"给块加上下文-让它自足"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代码检索的特殊性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/foundations/code-vs-text-retrieval"},"next":{"title":"代码嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/indexing/code-embeddings"}}